    <p>Data Format (v.data):</p>

<pre>var data = [
  { question: 'Quisque pretium a arcu ac faucibus?', answer: '&lt;p&gt;Yes.&lt;/p&gt;' },
  { question: 'Mauris ipsum nisl, aliquam posuere consectetur nec, volutpat eget mi?', answer: '&lt;p&gt;No.&lt;/p&gt;' },
  { question: 'Nunc cursus ante eget dui ultricies dictum?', answer: '&lt;p&gt;75&lt;/p&gt;' },
];</pre>

    <p>Note: Answer is a rich text field</p>

